nd(i+1);\n		}\n		String s = sb.toString();\n		//System.out.println(s);\n		Permutation perm = new Permutation(s);\n		int a = perm.list.indexOf(p) + 1;\n		int b = perm.list.indexOf(q) + 1;\n		result = abs(a - b);\n		\n		//System.out.println(perm.list);\n		\n		// 出力\n		System.out.println(result);\n	}\n}\n\nclass Permutation {\n    int n;\n    String s;\n    ArrayList<String> list;\n    \n    public Permutation(String s){\n        this.n = s.length();\n        this.s = s;\n        \n        boolean[] used = new boolean[n];\n        ArrayList<String> list = new ArrayList<String>();\n        dfs(\"\", used, list);\n        this.list = list;\n    }\n    \n    private void dfs(String s, boolean[] used, ArrayList<String> list){\n        if(s.length() == used.length){\n            list.add(s);\n            return;\n        }\n        for(int i = 0; i < used.length; i++){\n            if(used[i]) continue;\n            used[i] = true;\n            dfs(s + this.s.charAt(i), used, list);\n            used[i] = false;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n\n','code','Runtime Error','No abnormally found','Time Limit Exceeded','Memory Limit Exceeded','B',2),(2032,'Consider the following statements :\rA. High speed Ethernet works on optic fiber.\rB. A point to point protocol over Ethernet is a network protocol for encapsulating PPP frames inside Ethernet frames.\rC. High speed Ethernet does not work on optic fiber.\rD. A point to point protocol over Ethernet is a network protocol for encapsulating Ethernet frames inside PPP frames.\rWhich of the following is correct ?','code','A and B are true; C and D are false.','A and B are false; C and D are true.','A, B, C and D are true.','A, B, C and D are false.','A',5),(2033,'What is the output of the following code?\ncumsum[NaN]','code','NaN','0','Error due to NaN','Syntactical Error','C',5),(2034,'Which solution below is the most likely completion the following \ncode snippet to achieve the desired goal?\n\n\ndef unique(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return sort